  "texts": {
    "preamble": "T Vengala Rao vs The State Of Ap on 7 September, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh 1 The Honourable Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.3664 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "When the matter is taken up for hearing, both the learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor would submit that this matter is squarely covered by earlier decisions of this Court, whereunder the accused against whom similar cases were registered on the basis of similar set of facts were [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court as the prosecution is not maintainable against them under law and also on the ground that Tobacco products would not fall within the definition of 'food' as defined under Section 3(i)(j) of FSS Act and that the police are not authorized to register the crime and investigate the same and to file the charge sheet.",
